Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Source: OCR of hardcoded English subs ([1042-1043] Onigashima 44 - Let Us Face Death Together!.mp4); opening lyrics omitted}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:24.08,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Subtitles by HatSubs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.59,0:01:36.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Explain yourself, Drake!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.72,0:01:39.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is my brand of justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.35,0:01:43.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I envy you...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.40,0:01:53.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Finger Pistol.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.12,0:02:04.62,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1626,369)}Flower\NCapital
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.96,0:02:10.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Did you write your wish?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.75,0:02:13.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Light up the sky lantern boats!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.84,0:02:19.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Amazing! Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.68,0:02:22.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's so amaziiiing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.93,0:02:28.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right, let's send them off!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.89,0:02:31.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Send your wishes unto the skies!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.77,0:02:34.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.52,0:03:09.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.31,0:03:11.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Hydra!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.32,0:03:25.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's bending the direction\Nof his attacks?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.79,0:03:31.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's impossible!\NRubber doesn't work like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.54,0:03:36.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Owwie!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.51,0:03:43.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop it! That hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.39,0:03:46.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That hurts!\NI'm beggin' ya...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.22,0:03:49.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...pwease stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.72,0:03:53.23,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(209,546)}Drunken Beggar
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.73,0:03:56.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yer still drunk?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.11,0:04:04.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't think you're the only one\Nthat can see what's coming...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.70,0:04:11.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How 'bout we play copycat...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.75,0:04:23.76,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(924,529)}Drunken\NThief
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.71,0:04:23.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.55,0:04:28.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eeeyowowowow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.90,0:04:37.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He ate me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.86,0:04:40.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lemme out, ya jackass!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.70,0:04:47.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Open up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.66,0:04:57.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blast Breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.08,0:05:32.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boundman!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.79,0:05:38.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.50,0:05:47.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Man, I'm all beat up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.26,0:05:54.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come back for more, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.43,0:05:57.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How much longer can I last?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.02,0:06:00.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is my last Gear 4!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.99,0:06:15.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't got any more\Ntime to waste!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.84,0:06:28.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't quit on me, Gear 4!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.51,0:06:32.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.31,0:06:38.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I see now...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.81,0:06:41.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That power of his is\Nsurprisingly tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.15,0:06:43.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The rubber power, that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.52,0:06:45.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shuddup!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.03,0:06:50.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I absolutely gotta\Nkick your ass outta here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.12,0:06:58.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano's people...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.29,0:07:02.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...can hardly find water to drink!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.67,0:07:06.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They can't eat 'til they're full!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.13,0:07:11.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's all while you're still around!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.18,0:07:14.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That goes without saying!\NThey lost, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.56,0:07:19.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You oughta thank me\Nfor not murderin' the bunch!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.18,0:07:24.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't give a crap\Nwhose side you're on...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.57,0:07:30.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...but Wano's people are\Nexperienced losers!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.90,0:07:33.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The non-violent weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.36,0:07:35.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those who died with dignity!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.53,0:07:41.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even seen a bunch o' failures\Nmake up excuses!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.79,0:07:44.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shuddup!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.79,0:07:47.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The samurai are strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.71,0:07:52.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Strong, you say?\NOr just acting tough?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.72,0:07:57.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Winners don't need\Nno flowery titles!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.43,0:07:59.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Which one are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.06,0:08:01.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.15,0:08:07.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.94,0:08:14.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Over-Kong Gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.56,0:08:42.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.18,0:08:45.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I gotta make sure\Nhe's down and out...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.65,0:08:58.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...while I can still use Gear 4!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.99,0:09:01.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thunder Bellow...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.75,0:09:07.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Bagua!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.16,0:09:49.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No leaving allowed, strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.59,0:09:56.59,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1452,621)}Blood-\NThirsty\NDrunk
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.35,0:10:08.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One more shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.10,0:10:11.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's give this the perfect ending!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.56,0:10:13.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If this don't work...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.98,0:10:16.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Show me what ya got, whelp!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.69,0:10:19.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...then I lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.29,0:10:28.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gum-Gum...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.43,0:10:50.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Over...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.14,0:10:52.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thunder Bellow...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.32,0:10:56.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Iron Body!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.07,0:10:56.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.49,0:11:01.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,CP-0?!\NWhy are they here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.42,0:13:23.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.43,0:13:27.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy's voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.14,0:13:30.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can no longer hear it...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.20,0:13:51.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Battle of the Skull Dome Rooftop...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.74,0:13:53.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The victor:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.66,0:13:57.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido the Beast King.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.92,0:14:08.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know what this means\Nfor you, I presume...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.73,0:14:20.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.68,0:14:51.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kawamatsu-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.59,0:14:53.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The ceiling's about to collapse!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.64,0:14:54.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must evacuate!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.64,0:15:01.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thousands of our comrades\Nremain within the castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.35,0:15:03.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And we will make it\Nhome together, all of us!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.77,0:15:06.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Alas, we are in midair!\NThere is no water to be had!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.11,0:15:11.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There is naught we can do\Nto extinguish this blaze!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.04,0:15:20.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You must all flee, I beg you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.79,0:15:22.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There is no honor\Nin burning to death!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.05,0:15:36.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blast Breath?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.56,0:15:39.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It... cannot be...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.40,0:15:50.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido...!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.78,0:15:56.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Where's that boss of yours?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.99,0:15:58.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring me Oden's son!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.95,0:16:03.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna hear Momonosuke himself\Nannounce surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.71,0:16:06.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.00,0:16:10.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.34,0:16:13.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy's dead?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.27,0:16:22.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hatter's voice...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.39,0:16:23.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...vanished!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.19,0:16:26.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So he was no match for\Nan Emperor of the Sea...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.36,0:16:35.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What did you say...\Nabout Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.99,0:16:38.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It can't be true...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.12,0:16:40.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.50,0:16:48.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Luffy was killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.50,0:16:54.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If anybody else still wants to challenge me, step right up!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.47,0:16:58.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm in the mood to\Ncrack some more skulls.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.35,0:17:04.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He did it!\NKaido-sama's claimed total victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.11,0:17:10.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Bro Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.65,0:17:13.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don'cha go dyin' on me...!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.11,0:17:16.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.78,0:17:18.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't even think about goin', nope!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.66,0:17:20.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You want him to\Nkeep mouthing off?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.33,0:17:26.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell's that\Novergrown stake on about anyways?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.00,0:17:31.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Keep those damn lies to yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.26,0:17:41.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy's dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.51,0:17:44.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't even think about telling me\Nsome impossible lie!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.64,0:17:47.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When Luffy says he's going to win...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.81,0:17:50.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,he'll win, no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.03,0:17:55.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no way Luffy lost!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.07,0:17:58.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course he's not dead!\NThat's ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.61,0:17:59.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.82,0:18:04.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh? Well, at least one of you's\Ngot some moxie...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.79,0:18:05.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't believe you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.62,0:18:11.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Since I'm such a nice guy,\NI'll show ya what it means to be a loser!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.80,0:18:15.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Blast Breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.05,0:18:18.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.61,0:18:36.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-Nami-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.24,0:18:41.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't lose your head!\NNot 'til all's said and done!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.16,0:18:46.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.04,0:18:55.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just as planned, Onigashima's gonna land\Non the Flower Capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.21,0:18:59.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I ain't some pushover like Orochi!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.51,0:19:01.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He was too lenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.30,0:19:05.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This country is one giant\Nweapons factory!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.85,0:19:10.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Woman or child, I don't care who you are!\NEverybody's a slave!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.10,0:19:13.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Exhausted from working?\NDrop dead, for all I care!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.56,0:19:15.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's all your lives\Nare worth, anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.98,0:19:19.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if we lose slaves,\Nthere's plenty more where that came from!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.61,0:19:25.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You dared to fight back against me,\Nand earned my wrath!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.66,0:19:29.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is what it means to lose in war!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.54,0:19:35.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And the price of your defeat:\Nyour rights as humans, and your hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.71,0:19:43.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bring Momonosuke to me!\NThe fighting doesn't stop until I've dealt with him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.56,0:19:50.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano is finished, slaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.23,0:19:53.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your children, and your children's children\Nwill drown in despair!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.60,0:19:56.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Accept these terms of defeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.40,0:19:59.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,N-Not my wife and children!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.99,0:20:03.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, now's our chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.57,0:20:05.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lop off Kid's and Law's heads!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.07,0:20:08.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're practically dead anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.46,0:20:15.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You might've beaten Big Mom,\Nour last line of defense is Kaido-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.96,0:20:19.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys never stood a chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.26,0:20:22.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Damn nobodies...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.55,0:20:28.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Protect the captains!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.81,0:20:39.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido?!\NThis ain't good!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.07,0:20:40.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We gotta save everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.82,0:20:42.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.19,0:20:43.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.82,0:20:46.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mrrrrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.24,0:20:56.25,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1623,168)}Castle Interior\NBasement
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.29,0:20:53.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The inferno's on all sides!\NWe're done for!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.08,0:20:54.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is there no way out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.21,0:20:56.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Look for an exit!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.18,0:21:07.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna fight, Trafalgar...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.72,0:21:11.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No surrender...\NAin't gonna go down quietly!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.27,0:21:16.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Dammit, Straw Hatter...!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.07,0:21:25.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pre... Preposterous!\NImpossible, I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.90,0:21:29.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are we to do against someone\Nwhom even Luffy could not defeat?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.12,0:21:31.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We keep going until\Nwe've breathed our last!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.37,0:21:34.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We must fight,\Neven if it means death!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.45,0:21:36.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is that not what a samurai is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.00,0:21:40.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who but us can do it now?!\NEveryone else is torn to shreds!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.42,0:21:43.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even Kaido must be\Nheavily wounded by now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.96,0:21:45.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Speak not such foolishness!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.26,0:21:47.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After all, he is an Emperor of the Sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.85,0:21:53.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We misjudged the depths\Nof his strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.10,0:21:57.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We no longer have a chance!\NWe would only be adding more corpses to the pile!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.19,0:21:59.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It is time to admit defeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.56,0:22:03.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We did the best we could!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.23,0:22:06.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Much as it galls me,\Nif Luffy has indeed lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.65,0:22:09.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we must surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.70,0:22:13.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not!\NYou will do no such thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.12,0:22:16.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What meaning is there in survival...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.20,0:22:20.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,if we return to slavery,\Ncounting the days until we die?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.58,0:22:23.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Surrender does not mean salvation!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.84,0:22:26.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You absolutely will not surrender!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.67,0:22:31.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The regional Daimyo that\Nnever yielded to Orochi...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.18,0:22:33.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...died nobly, yet much to their chagrin.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.52,0:22:40.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How the last twenty years of Wano are defined,\Nhinges upon this war we wage!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.40,0:22:50.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.49,0:22:54.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you would let it all go to waste...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.66,0:22:58.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,then let us face death together!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.33,0:23:39.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.29,0:23:40.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.97,0:23:51.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.34,0:23:53.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hear them!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.81,0:24:04.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How long has it been...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.06,0:24:08.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zunesha, what is it you speak of?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.20,0:24:17.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I hear the Drums of Liberation!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.04,0:24:22.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For the first time\Nin eight hundred years...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.33,0:24:26.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He is here, I am certain!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.21,0:24:31.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wh... Who is?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.18,0:24:37.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Joyboy...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.51,0:24:39.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...has returned!
